  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NEP/2021/03 SAATHI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to raise awareness through the formation and promotion of the community user groups, mixed group of men and women, on binge drinking and its repercussion on family&#x2019;s economic and psychosocial health and community&#x2019;s peaceful environment. The intervention aims to capacitate women home based workers with skill-based training for their economic empowerment and enabling them to raise their voice against domestic violence and indiscriminate alcohol consumption by the male members in their family.</narrative>
  </description>
